{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/extras/ae99c3102ed8ac37d80dee4eef0f28b9.avif?t=1758714623\" width=600 height=235 /></span>From the creator of reactor idle, factory idle and city idle! <br> <br>Your mission is simple: <strong>HEAT UP THE PLANET</strong>, Yes, really. <br> <br>You\u2019ll start with clean technologies like solar panels that barely produce any heat, but soon begin to research less clean methods to produce even more heat. Who knows\u2014you might <br>actually succeed in overheating the planet. <br> <br>Managing excessive heat, however, is not an easy task. Be prepared for challenges and, yes, explosions. MANY EXPLOSIONS. In your defense, explosions also help heat up the planet. Explosions cause financial losses and can bankrupt you though...<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/extras/4815c1ff38b92987eebc2d6fd361937b.avif?t=1758714623\" width=600 height=235 /></span>This game introduces new features gradually. At first, you\u2019ll see only the basics to help you get started, but as you progress, more advanced technologies and mechanics will <br>unlock. It is a long journey with plenty to explore. <br> <br>Disclaimer: This game is HARD. <br>It is also a form of a puzzle game, requiring you to figure out efficient strategies to improve your setup and boost your income. <br>Keep in mind that perfection isn\u2019t the goal\u2014you\u2019ll need to focus on specific areas and make trade-offs. <br> <br>Are you ready for the challenge?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Placement genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/7568340ebdc92a5caab5a5e9e89be4c2fcab1db0.jpg"},{"name":"Wood burner placement genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/7568340ebdc92a5caab5a5e9e89be4c2fcab1db0.jpg"},{"name":"Chipper placement genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/7568340ebdc92a5caab5a5e9e89be4c2fcab1db0.jpg"},{"name":"Oil placement genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/7568340ebdc92a5caab5a5e9e89be4c2fcab1db0.jpg"},{"name":"Basalt heater placement genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/7568340ebdc92a5caab5a5e9e89be4c2fcab1db0.jpg"},{"name":"Solar booster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/3d42a2217fc7568705ee15ed6ceababfe2f83341.jpg"},{"name":"Solar Panel II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/252a3e2399a40a0506ad7d514d0d55ab932cf765.jpg"},{"name":"Small fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/f8133c72594f66ef0618d993c5c7d4f552a8b50b.jpg"},{"name":"Solar energizer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/44b45fe29700085e4dbdb55f2d8339ac4478f16f.jpg"},{"name":"Generator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3413560/04b72e20cc097d8900fc4b8b55eb3bbbc340da50.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413560?t=1758714623","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/a451696d14bcac343b7b439884d2142e2ec87c31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758714623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/4c8b6cb49b2adcb3dbbead2e5c7fd1861e6af5ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758714623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/4c8b6cb49b2adcb3dbbead2e5c7fd1861e6af5ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758714623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/extras/ae99c3102ed8ac37d80dee4eef0f28b9.avif?t=1758714623\" width=600 height=235 /></span>From the creator of reactor idle, factory idle and city idle! <br> <br>Your mission is simple: <strong>HEAT UP THE PLANET</strong>, Yes, really. <br> <br>You\u2019ll start with clean technologies like solar panels that barely produce any heat, but soon begin to research less clean methods to produce even more heat. Who knows\u2014you might <br>actually succeed in overheating the planet. <br> <br>Managing excessive heat, however, is not an easy task. Be prepared for challenges and, yes, explosions. MANY EXPLOSIONS. In your defense, explosions also help heat up the planet. Explosions cause financial losses and can bankrupt you though...<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413560/extras/4815c1ff38b92987eebc2d6fd361937b.avif?t=1758714623\" width=600 height=235 /></span>This game introduces new features gradually. At first, you\u2019ll see only the basics to help you get started, but as you progress, more advanced technologies and mechanics will <br>unlock. It is a long journey with plenty to explore. <br> <br>Disclaimer: This game is HARD. <br>It is also a form of a puzzle game, requiring you to figure out efficient strategies to improve your setup and boost your income. <br>Keep in mind that perfection isn\u2019t the goal\u2014you\u2019ll need to focus on specific areas and make trade-offs. <br> <br>Are you ready for the challenge?</p>","developers":["Grest Games O\u00dc"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2